24
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:11,760
We just have to follow the floating stones

25
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:14,480
to the entry of the first trial.

26
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,600
Old ghost Duanmu,

27
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,840
are we inside the Ancient God's body ?

28
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,400
This is just an entrance,

29
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,000
a passage leading to the Ancient God's body.

30
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,320
It may be

31
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:31,240
just a single hair of the Ancient God.

32
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,080
Stop with your nonsense.

33
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:38,000
If this is just a single hair,

34
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,160
wouldn't the Ancient God's body

35
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,200
be larger than planet Suzaku ?

36
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,600
An adult Ancient God's body

37
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:47,440
is many times larger than planet Suzaku.
